/10\"></div></div><div class=\"bg-white border border-black/10 p-8 shadow-sm relative\"><div class=\"space-y-6\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check text-[#0B2553]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>Constitutional Literacy Check</h2><p class=\"text-sm text-black/60 border-l-2 border-[#0B2553] pl-3\">Traditional politicians rely on emotional manipulation. Our network requires a fundamental understanding of municipal law and civic rights.</p><div class=\"space-y-4 mt-6\"><div class=\"p-4 border border-black/10 hover:border-black/30 transition-colors bg-black/5 cursor-pointer\"><p class=\"font-bold mb-2\">1. Under the 74th Constitutional Amendment Act, which of the following is a core responsibility of the Urban Local Body (ULB)?</p><div class=\"space-y-2 text-sm\"><label class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><input type=\"radio\" class=\"accent-[#0A0A0A]\" name=\"q1\"/> Foreign Policy</label><label class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><input type=\"radio\" class=\"accent-[#0A0A0A]\" name=\"q1\"/> Income Tax Collection</label><label class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><input type=\"radio\" class=\"accent-[#0A0A0A]\" name=\"q1\"/> Public Health &amp; Sanitation</label></div></div><div class=\"p-4 border border-black/10 hover:border-black/30 transition-colors bg-black/5 cursor-pointer\"><p class=\"font-bold mb-2\">2. What is the primary function of a Ward Committee?</p><div class=\"space-y-2 text-sm\"><label class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><input type=\"radio\" class=\"accent-[#0A0A0A]\" name=\"q2\"/> To elect the Chief Minister</label><label class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><input type=\"radio\" class=\"accent-[#0A0A0A]\" name=\"q2\"/> To decentralize municipal governance and ensure local citizen participation</label><label class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><input type=\"radio\" class=\"accent-[#0A0A0A]\" name=\"q2\"/> To manage state police forces</label></div></div></div><button class=\"mt-6 w-full bg-[#0A0A0A] text-white py-4 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest flex items-center justify-center gap-2 hover:bg-[#A11212] transition-colors\">Verify &amp; Continue <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></button></div></div></main></div><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-5b1711e075e5183b.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[8946,[\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-1b93a5baf91874e7.js\\\"],\\\"ThemeProvider\\\"]\\n3:I[57121,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n4:I[74581,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n5:I[61304,[],\\\"ClientPageRoot\\\"]\\n6:I[79306,[\\\"8500\\\",\\\"static/chunks/8500-f62a38ff68ab7f42.js\\\",\\\"915\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/campaign/onboarding/page-acd3bdd84c6f614b.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n9:I[90484,[],\\\"OutletBoundary\\\"]\\na:\\\"$Sreact.suspense\\\"\\nd:I[90484,[],\\\"ViewportBoundary\\\"]\\nf:I[90484,[],\\\"MetadataBoundary\\\"]\\n11:I[27123,[],\\\"default\\\",1]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/css/88074b3575cc8ac4.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/css/077b0eb4519a0c3d.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"0:{\\\"P\\\":null,\\\"c\\\":[\\\"\\\",\\\"campaign\\\",\\\"onboarding\\\"],\\\"q\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"i\\\":false,\\\"f\\\":[[[\\\"\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[